§ `Section 83.14 -- Application for an order of forfeiture`

-- (1) GATE-A-like grant limited by its own wording to two kinds of property: outside them NOTHING.
-- COVERS: encoded | s 83.14(1) the Attorney General may apply for an order of forfeiture | s 83.14(1)*
-- src:1597 | Forfeiture of Property
-- src:1598 | Application for order of forfeiture
-- src:1599 | 83.14 (1) The Attorney General may make an application to a judge of the Federal Court for an order of forfeiture in respect of
-- src:1600 | (a) property owned or controlled by or on behalf of a terrorist group; or
-- src:1601 | (b) property that has been or will be used, in whole or in part, to facilitate or carry out a terrorist activity.
@ref s 83.14(1) (src:1597-1601)
GIVEN `the property is owned or controlled by or on behalf of the group` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the group is a terrorist group, by s 83.01(1)` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `the property has been or will be used, in whole or in part, to facilitate or carry out a terrorist activity` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 83.14(1) the Attorney General may apply for an order of forfeiture` MEANS
    IF `the property has been or will be used, in whole or in part, to facilitate or carry out a terrorist activity`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE IF `the property is owned or controlled by or on behalf of the group`
         THEN CONSIDER `the group is a terrorist group, by s 83.01(1)`
              WHEN JUST TRUE THEN JUST TRUE
              WHEN JUST FALSE THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "property owned or controlled by or on behalf of a terrorist group"
              WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): whether the group is a terrorist group is for s 83.01(1)
         ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "may make an application to a judge of the Federal Court for an order of forfeiture in respect of"

